  },
  {
    "original": "Follow the Tribune Vivec?\r\n\r\nVivec was one of the three Living Gods of the Dunmer people, known as a Warrior-Poet and much beloved among this people.  His disappearance is widely believed to have caused the Red Year, but his worship persists all the same.\r\n\r\nFollower:\r\nIncreased persuasion and intimidate chance with favor.\r\n\r\nTenets:\r\nFulfill your destiny by saving Tamriel. Read the stories of others. Defeat epic foes. Never openly break the laws of the Great Houses. Dark Elves and those skilled in Speechcraft are most deserving of my favor.",
    "string": "Vivec était l'un des trois dieux vivants du peuple Dunmer, connu comme un guerrier-poète et très apprécié de ce peuple.  On pense généralement que sa disparition est à l’origine de l’Année rouge, mais son culte persiste néanmoins.\n\nDisciple:\nPersuasion accrue et chance d’intimidation avec faveur.\n\nPrincipes :\nAccomplissez votre destin en sauvant Tamriel. Lisez les histoires des autres. Battez des ennemis épiques. N’enfreignez jamais ouvertement les lois des Grandes Maisons. Les Elfes noirs et ceux qui maîtrisent la parole méritent particulièrement ma faveur.",
    "status": "TranslationComplete",
    "form_id": "05000842|Wintersun - GotT Patch.esp",
    "type": "MESG DESC",
    "index": null,
    "editor_id": "WSN_WorshipRequest_Message_Tribunal_Vivec"
  },
